# Intermediates. Every generator here writes a standalone HTML page beside
# its output and rewrites it on each run; with the faces embedded they are
# several MB each. No HTML in this folder is a source file.
*.html
# Anything rendered at a prefix other than the committed `appstore-*`.
preview-*.png
check-*.png

# The meal photo is a real photograph you supply; it is not committed.
meal.jpg
meal.jpeg
meal.png
